          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.1.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\n1. PURPOSE\nChange the furniture and decide what to buy, on a phone (D38).\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n- Analysis finishes, or an example on Home — src/ui/App.tsx:26\n3. SCREENS (left → right)\n- Chat · Piece card · Furniture tab · Materials gate · Notices (empty) · History — as-is captures of the \"Aparador\" example, `design/assets/studio/`\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n- Desktop ≥ 768 px: 3D left, 360–420 px panel right — src/ui/studio/Studio.tsx:33,302\n- Mobile: 3D 52 % / panel 48 %, a button flips it to 30 % — Studio.tsx:308\n- Notices and History replace the tabs, never the 3D — Studio.tsx:146\n- Shopping list only after the review (D30) — src/ui/studio/Materials.tsx:258\n5. COPY SOURCE\nsrc/ui/studio/*, src/ui/chat/*; expert text comes from the example design\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n- Pending notices, proposal, low-confidence pieces — the example has none; need an expert run\n- Analyzing — lives in capture.pen\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\nUI-1, UI-4, UI-5, UI-6, UI-11, B-2\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, bottom of this file.",
