          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.1.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\n1. PURPOSE\nEvery state the conversation and the notices go through after asking for a change, on a phone.\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n- \"Librero\" example, then the \"Hazlo de 90 cm de ancho\" suggestion; the simulated expert answers\n3. SCREENS (left → right)\n- Chat / Thinking\n- Chat / Proposal pending\n- Notices / Proposal\n- Materials / During proposal\n- Chat / Applied at own risk\n- Notices / Critical\n- Notices / Instant fixes\n- Notices / Previewing a fix\n- Notices / In the tray\n- Chat / Tray\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n- A change that adds a critical structural problem stays a proposal (D4, D36)\n- Notices offer an instant fix, the tray, or accepting as is (D37)\n- Hand edits are off while a proposal or an old version is shown — src/ui/studio/Studio.tsx:236\n5. COPY SOURCE\nsrc/ui/studio/*, src/ui/chat/*; notice text from src/application/notices.ts; expert replies from the simulated expert (src/adapters/llm/simulated/simulated.ts)\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n- Expert error and retry — needs a failing provider\n- Low-confidence pieces — only photo reconstructions produce them\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\nUI-1, UI-3, UI-6, UI-12, UI-13, UI-14\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, bottom of this file.",
